WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Standing medium kick hits Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.550
Crouching medium punch connects during the first Rush.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.150
Crouching heavy punch leads into the second cancel.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.750
Standing medium punch connects as Jamie’s Drive gauge empties.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.550
The second crouching heavy punch links to Super.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.550
Level 1 continues the multi-hit finisher.

7
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.400
Ryu lands after Level 1 while Jamie remains in burnout.
